<http://digistrucmed.org/normative-assertion/lu_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_n0065/na_0002> <http://digistrucmed.org/notes> "Agent-silver normative structure derived from exact source wording; human adjudication is required." .
