<http://digistrucmed.org/grade-record/lu_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_n0065/gr_0002> <http://digistrucmed.org/hasGradeValue> <http://digistrucmed.org/LevelOfEvidence_A> .
